# Deployment reliability — keep the railway up snapshot lean (faster, more
# resilient upload). None of the below is needed for the Docker image build
# (vite build + tsc + prisma generate); excluding them shrinks the tarball and
# the file count without touching application logic.
#
# IMPORTANT: bare dir names match at ANY depth (gitignore semantics). The
# top-level artifact dirs MUST be root-anchored (leading slash) so they don't
# also strip real source like src/runtime/reports or server/src/modules/reports
# — doing so broke `vite build` ("Could not resolve ./runtime/reports/index").
*.md
/reports/
/coverage/
.cache
server/.cache
.nyc_output
*.tsbuildinfo
